    answer: "Build a waitlist of clients who want earlier appointments and text them the moment a slot opens. Set a clear cancellation policy, such as 24 hours notice or a 50 percent fee, and state it on every booking confirmation and reminder. Use automated text reminders 24 hours and 2 hours before each appointment to reduce no shows. Offer a small perk, such as a complimentary add on, to clients who fill a same day opening. Track your no show rate weekly, and after two missed appointments, require a card on file for future bookings.",
